# Cabeceras de seguridad para Cloudflare Pages o Netlify.
# CSP por servicio:
#   - formspree.io → formulario de contacto (connect-src, form-action)
#   - app.cal.com / cal.com → embebido de agenda y eventos (script, frame, connect)
#   - d15766d6.sibforms.com → paso opcional de recursos / Brevo (connect, form-action)
#   - youtube-nocookie / open.spotify.com → reproductores tras clic (frame-src)
# script-src lleva 'unsafe-inline' porque React Router incrusta un script de hidratación;
# cuando el sitio esté estable puedes cambiarlo por los hashes de esos scripts.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://app.cal.com; font-src 'self'; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://open.spotify.com https://cal.com https://app.cal.com; connect-src 'self' https://formspree.io https://app.cal.com https://cal.com https://d15766d6.sibforms.com; form-action 'self' https://formspree.io https://d15766d6.sibforms.com; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'
